":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":13,"created_at":"2026-03-18T22:31:35Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T12:16:28Z","closed_at":"2026-08-18T12:10:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-18T12:10:35Z"},"body":"- Follow-up of #113586 \r\n- Follow-up of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117474\r\n- Works towards https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12323\r\n\r\nMoves `MethodBind` maps from `ClassDB` to `GDType`, to make access more efficient and to consolidate typing.\r\n\r\nThis one is not as trivial as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117474 (some decisions which I'm commenting below), but also not nearly as complicated as #113586. Overall, it should be relatively painless with targeted reviews :)\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\n\r\nOne thing of note is that a few classes currently accidentally bind the methods of supertypes (to the supertypes). For example:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/456bdea954ee24e48cb562bfbf531de1cd96e371/scene/resources/mesh.cpp#L2318\r\n\r\nCan be seen in the docs under `Mesh` instead of `ArrayMesh`:\r\n\r\n[docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_mesh.html#class-mesh-method-create-trimesh-shape](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_mesh.html#class-mesh-method-create-trimesh-shape)\r\n\r\nThis doesn't work anymore with the new approach, because `GDType` is finalized after `_bind_methods`.\r\nTo fix the specific issues, I decided to do the agnostic thing and move the bindings to where they're bound anyway (a practical no-op), with a comment for follow-ups to decide how to address it properly.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599/reactions","total_count":35,"+1":13,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":8,"eyes":7},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}